%description:
An Unstructured PDU session has one QoS flow, whose default QoS rule has no packet
filter: a QoS rule authored for the UE is an error of the core network (CoreControl) at
the session's establishment.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

*.ue[*].sessionType = "Unstructured"
*.ue[*].hasIpv4 = false
*.ue[*].numUnstructuredApps = 1
*.ue[*].unstructuredApp[0].source.packetLength = 100B
*.ue[*].unstructuredApp[0].source.productionInterval = 20ms
*.ue[*].unstructuredApp[0].source.initialProductionOffset = 0.1s
*.upf.nodeControl.unstructuredPrefix = "10.99.0.0/16"
*.upf.nodeControl.unstructuredServer = "server"
*.upf.nodeControl.unstructuredServerPort = 5000
*.upf.nodeControl.unstructuredPort = 5001
*.bearerConfigurator.ulQfiRules = [{ue: "ue[0]", filter: "*", qfi: 1}]

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
CoreControl: NrSessionTestNetwork.ue[0] requests an Unstructured session, which has one QoS flow and no QoS rules, but the ulQfiRules parameter of the bearer configurator has a rule scoped to it
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
